VxAtlas is a clean-room implementation. It contains no code from other
VxWorks analysis tools. Two of them are used as external test oracles only,
run unmodified from their own distributions by the scripts in tools/parity/:

  - vxhunter (https://github.com/PAGalaxyLab/vxhunter), BSD 2-Clause License
  - VxWorksSymTab_Finder.java, distributed with Ghidra
    (https://github.com/NationalSecurityAgency/ghidra), Apache License 2.0
